  <item>
    <title>06. Amy｜纹身是代表自由的符号？一个纹身师见证的 3000 次人生革命</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67cda41ee924d4525a6273b2</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67cda41ee924d4525a6273b2</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 09 Mar 2025 18:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期也同步在公众号</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/GQ9u_aBB6RUJSkGQ3LLwXg" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/GQ9u_aBB6RUJSkGQ3LLwXg"><span>「一间宇宙尽头的橘铺」</span></a><span>🔍点击可读</span></p><span></span><p><span>▪️</span></p><span></span><p><span>纹身是我们刻在皮肤上会说话的生命诗歌，是我们主动选择的力量和能量符号。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期嘉宾，邀请的是我的纹身师Amy。她用针尖为别人勾勒着独属的精神图腾，让人可以从她设计的纹身图案里感受到一种「会呼吸的能量场」🫧</span></p><span></span><p><span>此时忍不住给大家看看我的纹身，我真的很爱🥰</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fhe7CkiC2rVLivy7gamKvkIkMHjj.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>1、本期嘉宾</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>👩</span><strong><span>Amy：多重身份的纹身师</span></strong><span>🎨</span></p><span></span><p><span>擅长将客人的生命故事转化为流动的能量符号，把纹身转换为一种会呼吸会流动的皮肤叙事，让纹身过程变成自由生命力的通道。</span></p><span></span><p><span>🍠小红书：AmyTattooer</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpW2Ck7PGKLx0wl9NFrtvZd9Rc9u.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>2、一些高光记录 🌟</span></strong></p><span></span><blockquote><span>纹身相当于是自己给自己设定的一个能量符号</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>行为自由、灵魂自由，加上没有分别心的爱，这些是人本身该有的，而只是我们拾回了自己而已</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>生命不会给我能力以外打不了的怪兽</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>碰壁、撞南墙、受伤，不断地撕碎自己，然后不断地一片一片拾起，再把自己拼起来，或者是再让自己去领悟。在下一次再去碰壁，再去捡起来，再去拼凑起来。就好像我永远有一个能复活的能力</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>纹身师要沉下去，见众生；艺术家要飞起来，见天地</span></blockquote><span></span><p><strong><span>3、时间线 📻</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="27">00:00:27</a> 自由纹身的双面性⚖️</span></p><span></span><p><span>长大后发现，疯狂与代价是自由的同义词</span></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>Part1 纹身哲学</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="218">03:38</a> 信任灵感，活在当下：💃创作与人生阶段共舞</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="322">05:22</a> 「空心圆的重量」带来的透气感💫</span></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>Part2 生活智慧的启示</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="553">09:13</a> 营养来自柔软，硬碰硬只会受伤</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="730">12:10</a> 💡让进步成为肌肉记忆</span></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>Part3 命运纹路</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1704">28:24</a> 因为纹身，我躲过了一场严重车祸</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2104">35:04</a> 给我纹身启蒙的红色宝箱🧳</span></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>Part4 能量哲学</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2637">43:57</a> 独处充电🔋：能量回收与输出的循环</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3335">55:35</a> 💸金钱流动法则：得失皆自然，执着不如顺应</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3596">59:56</a> 自由的重生🕊️：将破碎版本拼成更高级的版本</span></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>Part5 纹身的艺术与疗愈力量</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3939">01:05:39</a> 纹身三重自由🦋：行为自由、灵魂自由、无分别心的爱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4346">01:12:26</a> 身体作为人生地图的载体，有独特的故事性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4592">01:16:32</a> 纹身的疗愈性：皮肤刺痛 vs 心灵郁结释放</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5315">01:28:35</a> 纹身它只是一个选择，不是必需品</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>4、主播介绍</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>👩‍🦱世鸿：</span></strong><span>爆炸卷的川妹子，户外徒步+越野跑玩家，「重启人生」沙盘银牌主持人🥈，很擅长帮人存钱的保险经纪人✅</span></p><span></span><p><span>即刻：</span><a href="https://okjk.co/0S5IqR" data-url="https://okjk.co/0S5IqR"><span>山中野橘子</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎来围观我「生鲜市场」般朋友圈</span></p><span></span><p><span>📍可加vx：Dimy-Ne（备注播客）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fk3WMVC0KP93GyA5JAfm2Qv2ZQVs.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>5、本期相关信息</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>📚 书籍：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>《refuse to choose》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>《大自然教给我们的生存之道——八堂自然课》</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>🎵 音乐：Dream like me — 卢广仲/黑裙子</span></p><span></span><p><span>📀 本期制作：剪辑/文本 — 世鸿</span></p>]]></description>
